  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TbGEIu5.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Skinned Lanterns</h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Мод, добавляющий в игру больше фонарей! Вдохновлен Skinned Carts!</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OHXm6A6.png\" alt=\"Обзор фонарей\" width=\"717\" height=\"380\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oUNoK2X.png\" alt=\"Обзор фонарей\" width=\"717\" height=\"380\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/19Yfrtf.png\" alt=\"Обзор фонарей\" width=\"717\" height=\"380\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E3UjnnI.png\" alt=\"Обзор фонарей\" width=\"717\" height=\"380\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Совместимость мода</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Endergetic Expansion</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IqCNdsO.png\" alt=\"Фонари Endergetic Expansion\" width=\"454\" height=\"241\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W1OJ3eZ.png\" alt=\"Фонари Endergetic Expansion\" width=\"454\" height=\"241\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sRfWqlG.png\" alt=\"Фонарь Botania\" width=\"454\" height=\"240\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"f